| `input_adb_lookup(a.csv)`
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach src.ip, dest-host, 9lives [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Ignore values ###```
| eval src.ip = if(in(src.ip, ""), null(), src.ip) dest-host = if(in(dest-host, ""), null(), dest-host) 9lives = if(in(9lives, ""), null(), 9lives) naïve = if(in(naïve, ""), null(), naïve)
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="a.csv", "a")
```### Shallow merge assets with matching key fields (using basic stats) ###```
| eval _key = src.ip
| search _key=*
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, values(src.ip) as src.ip, values(dest-host) as dest-host, values(9lives) as 9lives, latest(naïve) as naïve by _key
```### Deep merge assets with matching key fields (using custom command) ###```
| eval _key = src.ip
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, values(src.ip) as src.ip, values(dest-host) as dest-host, values(9lives) as 9lives, latest(naïve) as naïve by _key
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval src.ip = mvindex(src.ip,0,4), dest-host = mvindex(dest-host,0,4), 9lives = mvindex(9lives,0,4)
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, src.ip, dest-host, 9lives, naïve
| outputlookup assetdb
